<title>USA: Coachmen Ind completes public stock offer.</title>
<headline>Coachmen Ind completes public stock offer.</headline>
<dateline>ELKHART, Ind. 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coachmen Industries Inc said Wednesday it completed a public offering of more than two million common shares at $24.50 each.</p>
<p>The company said it sold 1.8 million shares, while 270,000 were sold as part of an overallotment option. The lead underwriter was Oppenheimer &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Coachmen Industries manufactures recreational vehicles and modular homes.</p>
<p>The company's stock was down 3/8 at 26-1/4.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787</p>
